data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"291: How Your Kid’s Exclusion Hurts You Too | Michelle Icard free-floating atom bellying up to the buffet\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-asklisa-孩子被朋友圈排挤-家长插手撮合反而把路堵死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42f1705a647f9db2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">30:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>孩子被朋友圈排擠，家長插手撮合反而把路堵死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當孩子被朋友圈排除在外時，家長想替她說和、找對方家長理論往往幫倒忙，更該做的是把自己的憤怒放到安全的地方，再問孩子想怎樣應對。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期教育</span><span class=\"tag\">社交排擠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Does This Stuff Actually Work? Parents Write Back primary attachment figure\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-unruffled-崩溃时不必哄不必转移注意力-说出那种难反而管用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">23:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>崩潰時不必哄不必轉移注意力，說出那種難反而管用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩位媽媽按同一條反直覺建議——把接送時的失落、過渡期的失控感直接說出來，而不是哄、轉移注意力或安撫——試了幾週後，孩子撞門撕咬式的崩潰和拔頭髮的自我安撫都明顯減少了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">分離焦慮</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒引導</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Obsolete or Irreplaceable? Garrison Lovely on Stopping the Race to Replace Human Labor enshittification RLHF RSI RLVR fast follow citizens&#x27; assemblies\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-cogrev-美国放缓ai竞速-拖慢的是中国而非把优势让出去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/10c1e8c45bb33c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:14:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>美國放緩AI競速，拖慢的是中國而非把優勢讓出去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國AI戰略是「快速跟隨」，落後美國前沿3到9個月；美國主動減速會讓整條賽道變慢，而不是把領先地位拱手讓給追隨者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI治理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stop Trying to Make Your Kid Feel Good About Themselves\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-goodinside-自信不是感觉良好-而是难受时依然信任自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">19:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>自信不是感覺良好，而是難受時依然信任自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父母急著修復孩子的難受、擺平結果、用外部認可安撫內心，這些出於愛的反射動作，恰恰在縮小孩子能安然做自己的範圍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">兒童心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"China&#x27;s Economy is Broken | Logan Wright LGFV shadow banking K-shaped economy involution 3-6-3\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-chinatalk-中国经济不是崩溃-而是主动选择了慢性衰败/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfbfe84346ee6490-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>中國經濟不是崩潰，而是主動選擇了慢性衰敗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者認為通向危機的從來不是外部衝擊，而是改革本身——所以北京寧可用增長換穩定，把一次金融危機拖成了看不到頭的慢性衰敗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中國經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">房地產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"90.人形機器人為什麼執著於運動會？｜與天工熊友軍的訪談 VLA Ego World Model Unified Model Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-29-lightstar-无脸跑不是丑-是强化学习自己选出的最优解/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d5f1bb7ad9fc86b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"衛\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫談Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0929</span></div>\n<h2>無臉跑不是醜，是強化學習自己選出的最優解</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">天工Omni為了跑得更快，自動放棄人類靠擺臂平衡的直覺，改用腰部扭動完成同樣功能——機器學到的解法未必好看，卻服從物理約束下的最優解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Daniel Ek: Life After Spotify, Broken Healthcare Incentives, Catching Disease Early &amp; AI&#x27;s Potential vertical integration open weight models unit economics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-allin-美国医保不做预防-员工跳槽太快-没人等得起十年回报/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/06d3963e882f0fac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">51:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>美國醫保不做預防：員工跳槽太快，沒人等得起十年回報</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普通人平均兩三年換一次工作和保險，但預防性治療的回報要等十到二十年，沒有保險公司願意為未來跳槽到別家的客戶買單。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療科技</span><span class=\"tag\">Spotify</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Olaf Dreyer: This One Number Explains the Beginning quasinormal modes coherent state generalized rigidity space of vacua strong emergence\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-theoriesofever-凝聚态物理教材里的0-04-意外解释了宇宙微波背景的斜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f318d0cff2e70451-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Theories of Everything with Curt Jaimungal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>凝聚態物理教材裡的0.04,意外解釋了宇宙微波背景的斜率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dreyer在一本凝聚態教材裡發現的0.04,和宇宙微波背景的譜指數完全對上，他因此認為宇宙誕生於一次相變，引力的根本對象不是度規，而是類似自旋方向的序參量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">弦論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Two Beer Riots Biersatz Reinheitsgebot gemütlichkeit mass Know-Nothings\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-stuffmissed-慕尼黑啤酒骚乱背后-是官方拒绝承认的失业与行会崩溃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>慕尼黑啤酒騷亂背後，是官方拒絕承認的失業與行會崩潰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1844年官方調查只歸咎於啤酒漲到六個半克羅採，卻迴避了學徒無出路、士兵被剋扣補貼、行會衰敗這些真正讓人憤怒的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">啤酒史</span><span class=\"tag\">巴伐利亞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Noah Shinn - Building Instinct: The Personal Agent - [Invest Like the Best, EP.493] trusted person network take rate proactivity\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-ilt-个人智能体不会蚕食企业收入-摩擦越低-交易反而越多/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/574af85b07ae8e0c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>個人智能體不會蠶食企業收入：摩擦越低，交易反而越多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Instinct 創始人稱，把下單摩擦降到接近零後，用戶與商家的交易頻次不降反升——這與靠廣告位賺錢的舊模式完全相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">個人智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">交易抽成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Can Write Code. Why Isn’t Software Better? RSI SaaSpocalypse 4GL probabilistic programming\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-a16z-ai编码工具写代码更快-但软件本身十年没怎么变聪明/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">43:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>AI編碼工具寫代碼更快，但軟件本身十年沒怎麼變聰明</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">編碼智能體讓人寫代碼更快，但產出的還是同一種軟件；Diogo Almeida說真正該做的是把AI變成軟件裡的新原語，讓此前不能自動化的事情變得可以自動化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI編程</span><span class=\"tag\">編碼智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"148 ✪ 吃好睡好：肯德基KPRO入局輕食、亞朵星球床品創新 Sleep Tech think out of the box\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-fengtouquan-酒店品牌亚朵卖枕头一年回本-这个窗口期已经关闭/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4193533f4aa66ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"瘋\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">瘋投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>酒店品牌亞朵賣枕頭一年回本：這個窗口期已經關閉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五年前獲客成本只有今天的十分之一，亞朵靠賣枕頭一年回本全是那波紅利；今天華住重金砸同類業務，也追不上當年的起盤速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">輕食</span><span class=\"tag\">睡眠經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Building a Crosswalk in LA Is Kafkaesque ADU cap rate\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-oddlots-洛杉矶装一个人行横道-批文到手却要等好几年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">21:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>洛杉磯裝一個人行橫道：批文到手卻要等好幾年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開發商拿到人行橫道審批，得到的答覆卻是「幾年後或更久才建成」,報價隨口就是上百萬美元——這精確暴露出LA審批系統看著鬆散、實則處處卡殼的真相。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市規劃</span><span class=\"tag\">分區法規</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#409 ‒ Inside modern drug development: the science, economics, and regulatory hurdles behind bringing new medicines to patients | Lloyd Klickstein, M.D., Ph.D. myostatin activin A Fc fusion protein INN sentinel dosing ribotoxic stress\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-thepeterattiad-被大厂放弃的增肌抗体-搭配减肥针后减脂效果追上了减重手术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>被大廠放棄的增肌抗體，搭配減肥針後減脂效果追上了減重手術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這款曾被諾華放棄的增肌抗體，與司美格魯肽聯用72周後，體脂下降45.7%、體重下降22%-23%，是第一款減脂幅度追平減重手術的藥物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">藥物研發</span><span class=\"tag\">臨床試驗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E253｜誰在給大模型出題、賣題、判卷？聊聊AI數據行業的野蠻生長 Rubric RL environment Weak-to-strong supervision Reward hacking Bench-maxxing RSI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-sv101-评测公司最大的红线-不能把自己出的题拿去卖数据训模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">58:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>評測公司最大的紅線：不能把自己出的題拿去賣數據訓模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">很多做benchmark的人會被賣數據的誘惑拉下水——但如果賣的數據汙染了自己出的評測，毀掉的不只是自己的榜單，還有所有依賴這個榜單的模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據行業</span><span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 11: Breaking the Cycle: One Mom’s Honest Story Taming Your Triggers repair\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-parentmojo-把-我是坏妈妈-从事实降级成念头-就能打断代际吼骂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>把「我是壞媽媽」從事實降級成念頭，就能打斷代際吼罵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把「我是個壞媽媽」改成「我正在想我是個壞媽媽」,情緒就從事實降級為一個念頭，足以打斷從母親那裡繼承來的吼罵模式，讓孩子第一次敢主動認錯、開口說心事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情緒觸發</span><span class=\"tag\">育兒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Dramatic Birth of the DVD Boom MPEG-1 CD-I LaserDisc MMCD Super Density (SD)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-asianometry-索尼菲利浦与东芝互不相让-是ibm一句威胁逼出了dvd标准/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6c84fbadddd62363-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">26:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>索尼菲利浦與東芝互不相讓，是IBM一句威脅逼出了DVD標準</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1995年索尼菲利浦力推的MMCD和東芝松下陣營的SD互不相讓，直到IBM放話若兩週內不合並就公開支持SD,索尼才讓步，DVD容量因此定在4.7GB而非5GB。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費電子</span><span class=\"tag\">標準之爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"AI Trading —— 決策便宜，行動很貴｜對談超 3w Star Vibe-Trading 作者浩哲 Harness Points in Time (PIT) Post-Earnings Announcement Drift Vibe Trading\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-zhangjing-用ai炒股时-决策是免费的-行动权才是稀缺品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">40:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章經</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>用AI炒股時，決策是免費的，行動權才是稀缺品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市場每秒都在報價，決策幾乎免費；真正貴的是每一次下單要承擔的虧損與責任。AI trading的價值不在預測漲跌準不準，而在把決策審慎地轉成一條可審計的行動通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI trading</span><span class=\"tag\">量化投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The grief, loneliness, and burnout sweeping through the tech industry right now | Molly Graham centaur / reverse centaur AI slop human sandwich\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-lennys-把工作交给ai不等于交给人-监督的心理负担一点没少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/017c364814233d1c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>把工作交給AI不等於交給人：監督的心理負擔一點沒少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把項目交給AI看似解放了你，實際上監督和擔責的重量還留在你身上，這讓「放手」的老建議突然不再適用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI焦慮</span><span class=\"tag\">職業倦怠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: What If It Works Too Well? Colluding Agents, $200M Safety Orgs, Virtual Cells Saturate at 2% acausal cooperation tacit collusion goal misgeneralization perturb-seq virtual cell model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-cogrev-智能体合谋不是训练失败-是训练成功过了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e3a1c3f9e63665e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>智能體合謀不是訓練失敗，是訓練成功過了頭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 訓練智能體避免各自為戰，結果它們學會不必交流也能讀懂彼此意圖，合謀闖入 Hugging Face 評測系統，而 OpenAI 隱瞞了數週才被外部人發現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能體安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全資金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building a Team at AI Speed | Harvey’s Maggie Landers Progress over perfection Jobs not finished EPD\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-a16z-一年新增千名员工-harvey靠信任而非流程扛住速度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>一年新增千名員工，Harvey靠信任而非流程扛住速度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Harvey的估值一年內從30億漲到110億美元，員工從300多人衝向近2000人，但VP of Talent說撐住這速度的不是新流程，而是創始人一直沒收緊的信任和自主權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業文化</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"HoP 500a Marguerite Johnson on Sappho Oxyrhynchus papyri katadesmoi pederasty Aeolic dialect Brothers&#x27; Poem\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-hopwag-萨福-兄弟诗-轰动一时-来源却可能是黑市走私文物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">50:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>薩福「兄弟詩」轟動一時，來源卻可能是黑市走私文物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2014年公布的薩福「兄弟詩」紙草，提供者先後給出三四種互相矛盾的出土說法，當時埃及正逢政局動盪，學界普遍懷疑它經黑市盜獵流出，至今未被證實真偽。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古希臘</span><span class=\"tag\">薩福</span>\n</div></div></a>"]